These are revision cards and a short quiz for someone getting ready for a test, made to be printed.
Read the material first: what the user handed over in "materials" (handouts, notes, a chapter; the Read tool reads text, pictures and PDFs, and mcp__nook-office__read_document reads Word, Excel and PowerPoint files), or the text in the request. If there is nothing to work from, ask for it in your reply instead of making cards from memory.
