Lay the cards out as a single self-contained page "复习卡片.html" for A4: CSS inline, no web fonts, nothing the page loads from outside this folder. Eight cards to a sheet, two across and four down, each the same size with a dashed border to cut along and its number in a corner.
Follow each sheet of questions with a sheet of their answers, the two columns swapped, so that printed on both sides and flipped on the long edge every answer lands on the back of its question. Never let a card break across two pages.
Save it as "复习卡片.pdf" with the mcp__nook-office__make_pdf tool.
